# =====================
# Privacy policy / data deletion pages (added 2026-08-08)
# =====================
#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html .\templates\includes\footer_links.html
msgid "Privacy Policy"
msgstr "Maxfiylik siyosati"

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html .\templates\data_deletion.html
msgid "Last updated: 8 August 2026"
msgstr "Oxirgi yangilanish: 2026-yil 8-avgust"

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "This Privacy Policy explains what personal data InTask collects, why we collect it, who we share it with, and how you can delete it. It applies to the intask.uz website and the InTask Android application (package uz.intask.app)."
msgstr "Ushbu Maxfiylik siyosati InTask qanday shaxsiy ma'lumotlarni to'plashini, ularni nima uchun to'plashimizni, kim bilan bo'lishishimizni va ularni qanday o'chirishingiz mumkinligini tushuntiradi. U intask.uz veb-sayti va InTask Android ilovasiga (uz.intask.app paketi) taalluqlidir."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "1. What we collect"
msgstr "1. Qanday ma'lumotlarni to'playmiz"

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "Account data (all users):"
msgstr "Hisob ma'lumotlari (barcha foydalanuvchilar):"

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "Phone number — used as your login identifier and to send SMS verification codes."
msgstr "Telefon raqami — tizimga kirish identifikatori sifatida va SMS tasdiqlash kodlarini yuborish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "Account role (worker or employer) and registration date."
msgstr "Hisob roli (usta yoki ish beruvchi) va ro'yxatdan o'tgan sana."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "Worker profile data (entered by you):"
msgstr "Usta profili ma'lumotlari (siz kiritasiz):"

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "First name, last name, age and gender."
msgstr "Ism, familiya, yosh va jins."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "Profile photo, if you upload one."
msgstr "Profil surati (agar yuklasangiz)."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "Profession and certificate files, if you upload them."
msgstr "Kasb va sertifikat fayllari (agar yuklasangiz)."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "Job posting data (entered by employers):"
msgstr "E'lon ma'lumotlari (ish beruvchilar kiritadi):"

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "Job title, description, region, pay range and job photos."
msgstr "Ish nomi, tavsifi, hudud, maosh oralig'i va ish suratlari."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "A contact phone number, which is displayed publicly on the job page."
msgstr "Aloqa telefon raqami — u e'lon sahifasida ochiq ko'rsatiladi."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "The job location as map coordinates. If you use the “get location” button when creating a job, your device's GPS location is read at that moment and stored as the job's coordinates."
msgstr "Ish joyining xaritadagi koordinatalari. E'lon yaratishda “joylashuvni aniqlash” tugmasidan foydalansangiz, o'sha paytda qurilmangizning GPS joylashuvi o'qiladi va e'lonning koordinatalari sifatida saqlanadi."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "Job applications:"
msgstr "Ishga arizalar:"

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "When a worker applies to a job, we store which worker applied to which job, and the employer can see the worker's profile."
msgstr "Usta ishga ariza topshirganda, qaysi usta qaysi ishga ariza berganini saqlaymiz va ish beruvchi ustaning profilini ko'ra oladi."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "Verification codes:"
msgstr "Tasdiqlash kodlari:"

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "The one-time SMS code is stored on our server for a maximum of 5 minutes and is deleted as soon as it is used or expires."
msgstr "Bir martalik SMS kod serverimizda ko'pi bilan 5 daqiqa saqlanadi va ishlatilgan yoki muddati tugagan zahoti o'chiriladi."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "The “jobs near me” feature and the map on our landing page may ask your browser for your location. That location is used only on your device to centre the map and calculate distances; it is not sent to our server."
msgstr "“Yaqin-atrofdagi ishlar” funksiyasi va bosh sahifadagi xarita brauzeringizdan joylashuvingizni so'rashi mumkin. Bu joylashuv faqat qurilmangizda xaritani markazlash va masofalarni hisoblash uchun ishlatiladi; u serverimizga yuborilmaydi."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "2. Why we collect it"
msgstr "2. Nima uchun to'playmiz"

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "To create and sign in to your account using SMS verification."
msgstr "SMS tasdiqlash orqali hisob yaratish va tizimga kirish uchun."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "To show worker profiles to employers and job postings to workers — this is the core function of the platform."
msgstr "Usta profillarini ish beruvchilarga, e'lonlarni ustalarga ko'rsatish uchun — bu platformaning asosiy vazifasi."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "To show job locations on a map."
msgstr "Ish joylarini xaritada ko'rsatish uchun."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "To connect workers and employers when a job application is made."
msgstr "Ishga ariza berilganda usta va ish beruvchini bog'lash uchun."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "We do not use advertising or analytics trackers, and we do not sell your data."
msgstr "Biz reklama yoki analitika kuzatuvchilaridan foydalanmaymiz va ma'lumotlaringizni sotmaymiz."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "3. Who we share it with"
msgstr "3. Kim bilan bo'lishamiz"

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "Eskiz (notify.eskiz.uz) — an SMS provider in Uzbekistan. It receives your phone number and the verification message in order to deliver the SMS code."
msgstr "Eskiz (notify.eskiz.uz) — O'zbekistondagi SMS provayderi. SMS kodni yetkazish uchun u telefon raqamingiz va tasdiqlash xabarini oladi."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "Yandex Maps — used to display maps on job pages. When a map loads, Yandex receives standard technical data such as your IP address."
msgstr "Yandex Xaritalar — e'lon sahifalarida xaritalarni ko'rsatish uchun ishlatiladi. Xarita yuklanganda Yandex IP manzilingiz kabi standart texnik ma'lumotlarni oladi."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "Content delivery services (Google Fonts, jsDelivr, unpkg, Carto map tiles, Photon address search) — these load fonts, scripts, map tiles and address suggestions, and receive standard technical request data such as your IP address."
msgstr "Kontent yetkazish xizmatlari (Google Fonts, jsDelivr, unpkg, Carto xarita plitkalari, Photon manzil qidiruvi) — ular shriftlar, skriptlar, xarita plitkalari va manzil takliflarini yuklaydi hamda IP manzilingiz kabi standart texnik so'rov ma'lumotlarini oladi."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "Worker profile information (name, photo, profession) is visible to employers on the platform, and job postings (including the contact phone number and location) are visible to workers."
msgstr "Usta profili ma'lumotlari (ism, surat, kasb) platformada ish beruvchilarga ko'rinadi, e'lonlar esa (aloqa telefon raqami va joylashuv bilan birga) ustalarga ko'rinadi."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "4. How long we keep it"
msgstr "4. Qancha vaqt saqlaymiz"

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "We keep your account and profile data for as long as your account exists; we do not delete it automatically. SMS verification codes are kept for a maximum of 5 minutes. You can request deletion of your account and data at any time, as described below."
msgstr "Hisob va profil ma'lumotlaringizni hisobingiz mavjud bo'lgan davomida saqlaymiz; ularni avtomatik o'chirmaymiz. SMS tasdiqlash kodlari ko'pi bilan 5 daqiqa saqlanadi. Quyida tavsiflanganidek, istalgan vaqtda hisobingiz va ma'lumotlaringizni o'chirishni so'rashingiz mumkin."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "5. Your rights"
msgstr "5. Sizning huquqlaringiz"

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "You can view and edit your profile information at any time from the profile page."
msgstr "Profil sahifasida istalgan vaqtda profil ma'lumotlaringizni ko'rishingiz va tahrirlashingiz mumkin."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "You can request a copy of the data we hold about you."
msgstr "Siz haqingizda saqlanayotgan ma'lumotlar nusxasini so'rashingiz mumkin."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "You can request deletion of your account and all associated data."
msgstr "Hisobingiz va unga bog'liq barcha ma'lumotlarni o'chirishni so'rashingiz mumkin."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "6. How to delete your account and data"
msgstr "6. Hisobingiz va ma'lumotlaringizni qanday o'chirish mumkin"

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "Send an email to <a href=\"mailto:support@intask.uz\">support@intask.uz</a> stating the phone number you registered with. We will verify that you control that phone number and then delete your account together with your profile, uploaded photos and certificates, job postings and job applications."
msgstr "Ro'yxatdan o'tgan telefon raqamingizni ko'rsatib, <a href=\"mailto:support@intask.uz\">support@intask.uz</a> manziliga xat yuboring. Biz bu telefon raqami sizniki ekanini tekshiramiz, so'ng hisobingizni profilingiz, yuklangan suratlar va sertifikatlar, e'lonlaringiz va arizalaringiz bilan birga o'chiramiz."

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "Step-by-step deletion instructions"
msgstr "Bosqichma-bosqich o'chirish yo'riqnomasi"

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "7. Contact"
msgstr "7. Aloqa"

#: .\templates\privacy_policy.html
msgid "For any question about this policy or your data:"
msgstr "Ushbu siyosat yoki ma'lumotlaringiz bo'yicha har qanday savol uchun:"

#: .\templates\data_deletion.html
msgid "Delete your InTask account and data"
msgstr "InTask hisobingiz va ma'lumotlaringizni o'chirish"

#: .\templates\data_deletion.html
msgid "You can request deletion of your InTask account and all data associated with it at any time. You do not need the app installed to make this request."
msgstr "InTask hisobingiz va unga bog'liq barcha ma'lumotlarni o'chirishni istalgan vaqtda so'rashingiz mumkin. Bu so'rov uchun ilova o'rnatilgan bo'lishi shart emas."

#: .\templates\data_deletion.html
msgid "How to request deletion"
msgstr "O'chirishni qanday so'rash mumkin"

#: .\templates\data_deletion.html
msgid "Send an email to <a href=\"mailto:support@intask.uz\">support@intask.uz</a> with the subject “Delete my account”."
msgstr "<a href=\"mailto:support@intask.uz\">support@intask.uz</a> manziliga “Delete my account” mavzusi bilan xat yuboring."

#: .\templates\data_deletion.html
msgid "In the email, state the phone number you registered with (for example +998 90 123 45 67)."
msgstr "Xatda ro'yxatdan o'tgan telefon raqamingizni ko'rsating (masalan, +998 90 123 45 67)."

#: .\templates\data_deletion.html
msgid "We will verify that you control that phone number, for example by sending a confirmation code to it."
msgstr "Bu telefon raqami sizniki ekanini tekshiramiz, masalan, unga tasdiqlash kodi yuborish orqali."

#: .\templates\data_deletion.html
msgid "Once verified, we delete your account and associated data."
msgstr "Tasdiqlangandan so'ng hisobingiz va unga bog'liq ma'lumotlarni o'chiramiz."

#: .\templates\data_deletion.html
msgid "What gets deleted"
msgstr "Nimalar o'chiriladi"

#: .\templates\data_deletion.html
msgid "Your account and phone number."
msgstr "Hisobingiz va telefon raqamingiz."

#: .\templates\data_deletion.html
msgid "Your worker profile, including your name, age, gender, photo and certificate files."
msgstr "Usta profilingiz, jumladan ismingiz, yoshingiz, jinsingiz, suratingiz va sertifikat fayllaringiz."

#: .\templates\data_deletion.html
msgid "Job postings you created, including their photos, contact phone number and location coordinates."
msgstr "Siz yaratgan e'lonlar, jumladan ularning suratlari, aloqa telefon raqami va joylashuv koordinatalari."

#: .\templates\data_deletion.html
msgid "Your job applications."
msgstr "Ishga arizalaringiz."

#: .\templates\data_deletion.html
msgid "SMS verification codes are not part of your stored account data — they expire automatically within 5 minutes."
msgstr "SMS tasdiqlash kodlari hisobingizda saqlanadigan ma'lumotlar tarkibiga kirmaydi — ular 5 daqiqa ichida avtomatik ravishda o'z kuchini yo'qotadi."

#: .\templates\data_deletion.html
msgid "Read our full Privacy Policy"
msgstr "To'liq Maxfiylik siyosatini o'qing"

#: .\templates\includes\footer_links.html
msgid "Delete account & data"
msgstr "Hisob va ma'lumotlarni o'chirish"
